# E215 draft — Boost.Test run-fail semantics on OHOS
id:                     E215-draft-boost-test-ohos-runfail
trigger_tool:           b2|boost.test
phase:                  test
error_signature:        run-fail.*exit.*0|system-exception-test.*no errors detected|failed testing.capture-output
severity:               2
category:               ohos, boost.test, signals, exceptions
match_keywords:         Boost.Test, run-fail, system-exception-test, signal, exception, OHOS
title:                  Boost.Test run-fail tests may return success on OHOS
root_cause:             A Boost.Test target classified as run-fail expects a non-zero process exit after an exception or signal. On AArch64, integer division by zero is not a portable SIGFPE trigger; at -O0 it can return 0, while at -O2 the undefined behavior may be folded to an arbitrary value. b2 can therefore report the run-fail wrapper as failed even when the test binary prints no errors.
affected_scope:         Boost.Test run-fail targets on OHOS, including system-exception-test; verify each target independently.
verification_cmd:       b2 -j1 system-exception-test
rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           platform-test-gating
rec_description:        Reproduce at the actual optimization level on an OHOS AArch64 device, retain stdout and exit status, and gate only the affected run-fail target by architecture. Do not treat a coincidental non-zero exit at -O2 as SIGFPE success or classify unrelated compiler interruptions as this issue.
rec_command:            b2 -j1 system-exception-test
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               manual-patch
forbid_1_pattern:       mark.*all.*run-fail.*skip|ignore.*exit.*status
forbid_1_reason:        The behavior is target-specific; broad skipping hides real failures.
principles:             P012, P014
causes:                 []
caused_by:              []
similar_to:             [E018, E046]
conflicts_with:         []
prerequisite_of:        []
doc_file:               doc/E215.md
last_updated:           2026-10-09
source_event:           Boost.Test 1.84.0 OHOS device validation
authors:
source_pr:
source_commit:
metrics_success_count:  0
metrics_fail_count:     0
metrics_confidence:     0.0
metrics_last_used:
